description	"Ponda Baba

A quick to anger brawler with hit and run tactics.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- DL-21 Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 20% Less Velocity, 20% Faster RoF
- Explosive Ruby Bliel (2)
-- Frag Grenade
-- Causes Blind, Slippery, Force Focus, Cripple, Poison

^8Attributes:
- Tracking Beacon
- Strength (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Fury (3)
- Knockdown Roll
- Blast Armor
- Water Breathing
- 70% Faster Skill Cooldowns

^3Powers:
- Drunken Rage (Rage 3)

^3Abilities:
- Shoulder Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS3]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Dexterity ^3[CS4]
- Cybernetic Flamethrower ^3[CS1]"